# Buildings & Content

## Patterns

- New buildings use standard `IBuildingConfig` (or project-equivalent Config) + building def registration.
- Register tech/research unlocks through the normal tech tree hooks; do not hard-unlock in random patches unless intentional.
- Prefer PLib building/options helpers when adding configurable content.

## Strings & balance

- UI / description text goes through localization strings (e.g. `STRINGS` or mod string tables), not magic literals scattered in logic.
- When adding numbers (power, heat, storage, rate), choose sane defaults and note balance intent in a short comment.
- IDs (`BuildingId`, tech IDs) must be stable; renaming breaks saves — treat as breaking change.

## Don't

- Don't embed machine-specific absolute paths in content code.
- Don't duplicate vanilla building logic wholesale; patch or compose when extending existing buildings.
